	"_note": "The web app's dependency budget is a security decision (docs/COURSE.md, Lesson 3): the runtime list stays deliberately short - Lit for UI, later pdf.js / sqlite-wasm / @noble / hash-wasm for viewers and the vault. No framework, no router package, no state library: those three are ours to write and they are small (web/src/lib/).",
	"name": "gorani-web",
	"private": true,
